# Open 23.1
tags: open, benchmark, 2023
stimulus: Five-movement chipper; the row and toes-to-bar decide whether you ever see a muscle-up.
note: Repeat of Open 14.4. Score is the total number of reps.
AMRAP 14:00
  60 cal Row
  50 Toes-to-bar
  40 Wall ball 20/14 lb
  30 Clean 135/95 lb
  20 Muscle-up
